      "writtenOn": "2025-07-21T18:41:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Switching over to TELEPHONY_DATA for devices running newer HALs would definitely make sense. The enforcement of that is (surprisingly, or maybe not surprisingly) a bit tricky due to various testing at various SDK levels and the dependence on HAL version (part of the morass created by the VSR). But, I have filed b/433287758 for this.",
